象，但认为这种下滑并非不可避免。麦肯锡公司欧洲执行合伙人通德·奥兰雷瓦朱 (Tunde Olanrewaju) 与彭博广播电台的本·博洛斯 (Ben Boulos) 和查尔斯·卡佩尔 (Charles Capel) 一起讨论了欧洲工业竞争力挑战的推动因素以及可以帮助企业反击的转型战略。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/how-do-europe-s-companies-regain-their-edge-video'&gt;欧洲企业如何重获优势？&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：How Do Europe's Companies Regain Their Edge?&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/how-do-europe-s-companies-regain-their-edge-video</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 11:42:01 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[CNBC] 由于科技抛售加剧，有报道称美国征收新关税，纳斯达克期货下跌：实时更新</title><link>https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/24/stock-market-today-live-updates-.html</link><description>华尔街正经历标准普尔 500 指数和纳斯达克综合指数的下跌。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[CNBC]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/24/stock-market-today-live-updates-.html'&gt;由于科技抛售加剧，有报道称美国征收新关税，纳斯达克期货下跌：实时更新&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Nasdaq futures tumble as AI sell-off returns with Nvidia, Anthropic leading the way: Live updates&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/24/stock-market-today-live-updates-.html</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 11:45:37 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] 债券交易员现在对冲加息，削减以后的情景</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-11-25/bond-traders-hedge-a-hike-now-cut-later-scenario</link><description>交易员认为利率上升可能会导致经济陷入困境。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-11-25/bond-traders-hedge-a-hike-now-cut-later-scenario'&gt;债券交易员现在对冲加息，削减以后的情景&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Bond Traders Hedge a Hike Now, Cut Later Scenario&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-11-25/bond-traders-hedge-a-hike-now-cut-later-scenario</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 11:47:54 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[金融时报] 默茨警告说，俄罗斯正在升级欧洲和太空冲突</title><link>https://www.ft.com/content/afdac003-51b0-43da-8c7c-b5675f9b7c1b?syn-25a6b1a6=1</link><description>德国总理试图说服日益持怀疑态度的民众继续支持乌克兰&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[金融时报]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.ft.com/content/afdac003-51b0-43da-8c7c-b5675f9b7c1b?syn-25a6b1a6=1'&gt;默茨警告说，俄罗斯正在升级欧洲和太空冲突&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Russia is escalating conflict in Europe and space, warns Merz&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.ft.com/content/afdac003-51b0-43da-8c7c-b5675f9b7c1b?syn-25a6b1a6=1</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 11:56:23 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] 俄罗斯石油出口增加导致全球供应过剩</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/russia-s-elevated-oil-exports-add-to-global-supply-surplus</link><description>今年的出口量高于 2022 年全面入侵乌克兰以来的所有年平均水平&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/russia-s-elevated-oil-exports-add-to-global-supply-surplus'&gt;俄罗斯石油出口增加导致全球供应过剩&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Russia’s Elevated Oil Exports Add to Global Supply Surplus&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/russia-s-elevated-oil-exports-add-to-global-supply-surplus</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 12:02:40 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] Nvidia 仍面临市值损失 2 万亿美元的问题</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/nvidia-still-faces-issues-that-cost-2-trillion-in-market-value</link><description>随着投资者开始认真思考仍然笼罩在这家全球最大芯片制造商身上的问题，英伟达首席执行官黄仁勋周一回归后，围绕该公司股价的乐观情绪正在消退。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/nvidia-still-faces-issues-that-cost-2-trillion-in-market-value'&gt;Nvidia 仍面临市值损失 2 万亿美元的问题&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Nvidia Still Faces Issues That Cost $2 Trillion in Market Value&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/nvidia-still-faces-issues-that-cost-2-trillion-in-market-value</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 12:20:58 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[CNBC] 莱斯曼：英伟达的鞭打测试了凯文·沃什（Kevin Warsh）解读市场信号的努力</title><link>https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/25/nvidia-kevin-warsh-fed-market-signals.html</link><description>上周市场的极端波动和围绕英伟达的戏剧性事件凸显了美联储主席凯文·沃什面临的困境。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[CNBC]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/25/nvidia-kevin-warsh-fed-market-signals.html'&gt;莱斯曼：英伟达的鞭打测试了凯文·沃什（Kevin Warsh）解读市场信号的努力&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Liesman: Nvidia whiplash tests Kevin Warsh’s push to read market signals&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/25/nvidia-kevin-warsh-fed-market-signals.html</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 12:26:41 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[华尔街日报] 避免与俄罗斯在波罗的海发生冲突的争夺战</title><link>https://www.wsj.com/world/europe/inside-the-scramble-to-avert-conflict-with-russia-in-the-baltic-4ec51b82?mod=rss_worldnews</link><description>两位北欧领导人在一位寡头的帮助下，找到了与弗拉基米尔·普京的直接联系，以缓解人们对北约封锁这条重要水道的担忧。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[华尔街日报]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.wsj.com/world/europe/inside-the-scramble-to-avert-conflict-with-russia-in-the-baltic-4ec51b82?mod=rss_worldnews'&gt;避免与俄罗斯在波罗的海发生冲突的争夺战&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Inside the Scramble to Avert Conflict With Russia in the Baltic&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.wsj.com/world/europe/inside-the-scramble-to-avert-conflict-with-russia-in-the-baltic-4ec51b82?mod=rss_worldnews</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 12:35:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[纽约时报] 随着人工智能的出现，股票抛售将继续球员再次倒下</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/25/business/stocks-sp500-nvidia-ai.html</link><description>由于投资者还担心关税和利率，英伟达、Anthropic 和其他科技公司的股价在盘前交易中暴跌，延续前一交易日的跌势。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[纽约时报]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/25/business/stocks-sp500-nvidia-ai.html'&gt;随着人工智能的出现，股票抛售将继续球员再次倒下&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Stock Sell-Off Set to Continue as A.I. Players Fall Again&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/25/business/stocks-sp500-nvidia-ai.html</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 12:36:06 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] Bullrich 与米莱选举改革会议</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/bullrich-confia-en-que-la-reforma-electoral-de-milei-sera-aprobada</link><description>帕特里夏·布尔里奇 (Patricia Bullrich) 表示，在阿根廷参议院对 PASO 的投票已足够，将改革 2027 年总统选举日程。（来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/bullrich-confia-en-que-la-reforma-electoral-de-milei-sera-aprobada'&gt;Bullrich 与米莱选举改革会议&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Bullrich confía en que la reforma electoral de Milei será aprobada&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/bullrich-confia-en-que-la-reforma-electoral-de-milei-sera-aprobada</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 12:45:52 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>